@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@studentA = 20152691234567890
@studentB = 20152691234567891

### Create class with 1 seat -> 201
# @name createClass
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Class 6 - Morning Shift", "totalSeats": 1 }

###
@classId = {{createClass.response.body.$.id}}

### List classes -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes

### Get one class -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}

### Student A holds a seat -> 201 (status HELD)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: {{studentA}}

### Student A again -> 409 ALREADY_APPLIED
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: {{studentA}}

### Student B, class is full -> 409 NO_SEATS
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: {{studentB}}

########## Invalid cases ##########

### totalSeats 0 -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Zero Seats", "totalSeats": 0 }

### Missing name -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "totalSeats": 10 }

### totalSeats "abc" -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bad Type", "totalSeats": "abc" }

### Missing X-Student-Id -> 400 INVALID_STUDENT_ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds

### X-Student-Id too short -> 400 INVALID_STUDENT_ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: 12345

### Malformed class id -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/not-a-guid

### Unknown class id -> 404 CLASS_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
